Enter wizmode. Create your own little nice +127 Vorpal blade (or whatever).
Or 255 Wands of Wishing. Go to level 2. Die. Answer "y" to the question "Save
bones?". Then start a new non-wiz character. Go directly to level 2. If it
is not the wiz ghost pile level, quit and start a new char until your level 2
is the wiz bones level. Then find the stack, the items may be cursed, but still
definitely worth having!

This probably the worst cheat possible in Nh. It is IMHO far worse than back-
upping save files (which I *do* consider cheating too btw). Yet it does allow
you to show up on the highscore table.

One possible solution:

	Characters who enter Wiz bones levels will not be scored (considered
	the same as discovery mode) and the same applies to characters who
	enter *their* bones levels. 
	Option for turning these "illegal" bones levels on/off.

